Conflicts: fonts-jetbrains-mono
Replaces: fonts-jetbrains-mono
Description: JetBrains Mono desktop fonts in four essential styles
 JetBrains Mono is a monospaced typeface for terminals and source code.
 This minimal package contains Regular, Bold, Italic and Bold Italic
 hinted TrueType fonts, with complete original character coverage.
 Additional weights, the NL family and web fonts are omitted.
